    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Warnings and imperatives",
     "texto": [
      "In an instruction, **må ikke** expresses a prohibition («must not») and **skal** can mark a compulsory step. Read the warnings first. **Koble fra støpselet før rengjøring** means «Unplug before cleaning».",
      "The time connectors **før** («before»), **mens** («while») and **etter** («after») show when to carry out an action. The sheet is a language exercise; always follow the instructions for the real appliance."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
